  "paragraphs": [
    "Good afternoon, colleagues. It is my honour to chair the next point.",
    "The next item is the report by Michael Gahler, on behalf of the Committee on Foreign Affairs, on the 2025 Commission Report on Ukraine (2025/2259(INI)) (A10-0172/2026). I would like to remind the speakers that, in view of the testing measures, strict adherence to speaking time will be required."
